.TH COBANG 1 "2026-10-28" "cobang 2.11.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cobang \- scan and generate QR codes and barcodes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cobang
.RI [ image ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cobang
is a native GTK application that scans QR codes and barcodes, either from a
webcam or from a still image, and decodes structured payloads such as URLs,
Wi-Fi credentials and plain text.
It can also generate QR codes from text or from a Wi-Fi network reported by
NetworkManager.
.PP
The application is designed for Wayland and uses GTK 4 with libadwaita.
When it runs inside a sandbox such as Flatpak, the webcam is reached through
the XDG desktop portal, otherwise the V4L2 device is opened directly.
.SH OPTIONS
.B cobang
takes no options.
Any other argument is treated as the path of an image file to open; only the
first one is used.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/bin/cobang
The launcher script.
.TP
.I /usr/share/cobang/
The Python modules, GResource bundle and UI definitions of the application.
.TP
.I /usr/share/applications/vn.hoabinh.quan.CoBang.desktop
The desktop entry, also used for D-Bus activation.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at
.UR https://github.com/hongquan/CoBang/issues
.UE .
.SH SEE ALSO
